medieval-store-spells-fire-bolt-tier1-name = Fire Bolt I
medieval-store-spells-fire-bolt-tier1-desc = Fire one straight bolt. Each bolt deals 10 Heat on impact and a one-tile Fire Magic explosion at intensity 1. Costs 15 mana.

medieval-store-spells-fire-bolt-tier2-name = Fire Bolt II
medieval-store-spells-fire-bolt-tier2-desc = Fire one cursor-guided bolt. Each bolt deals 10 Heat on impact and a one-tile Fire Magic explosion at intensity 1. Costs 25 mana.

medieval-store-spells-fire-bolt-tier3-name = Fire Bolt III
medieval-store-spells-fire-bolt-tier3-desc = Fire two cursor-guided bolts. Each bolt deals 10 Heat on impact and a one-tile Fire Magic explosion at intensity 2. Unlocks learning Fireball. Costs 35 mana.

medieval-store-spells-fire-bolt-tier4-name = Fire Bolt IV
medieval-store-spells-fire-bolt-tier4-desc = Fire three cursor-guided bolts. Each bolt deals 10 Heat on impact and a one-tile Fire Magic explosion at intensity 3. Costs 45 mana.

medieval-store-spells-large-fire-bolt-beginner-name = Large Firebolt I
medieval-store-spells-large-fire-bolt-beginner-desc = Fire one homing bolt. Each bolt deals 10 Heat on impact and a five-tile Fire Magic explosion at intensity 3 on open ground. Costs 25 mana.

medieval-store-spells-large-fire-bolt-middle-name = Large Firebolt II
medieval-store-spells-large-fire-bolt-middle-desc = Fire one homing bolt. Each bolt deals 10 Heat on impact and a five-tile Fire Magic explosion at intensity 5 on open ground. Unlocks learning Fireball. Costs 35 mana.

medieval-store-spells-large-fire-bolt-senior-name = Large Firebolt III
medieval-store-spells-large-fire-bolt-senior-desc = Fire up to two homing bolts. Each bolt deals 10 Heat on impact and a five-tile Fire Magic explosion at intensity 5 on open ground. Use MMB to select two targets. Costs 45 mana.

medieval-spell-speech-fire-bolt = Ignis sagitta!
